	"notice": "Enable MIDI input/output and clock with tempo + screen settings. Track channels and CCs can be edited in midi.json. TRS MIDI requires the optional oplab or line module; the base unit has no dedicated TRS MIDI sockets. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams show selected physical controls schematically, not a complete panel inventory. Unbound controls do not imply fixed MIDI assignments.",
